33:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"FAQs"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"Proprietorship questions, answered"}],null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card","children":[["$","details","What is a proprietorship?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-1","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What is a proprietorship?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"A proprietorship is a business owned by one individual. It is not incorporated and has no legal identity separate from its owner, so the proprietor personally owns the assets, owes the debts and is assessed to tax on the income."}]}]]}],["$","details","Is a proprietorship a separate legal entity?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-2","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is a proprietorship a separate legal entity?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"No. This is the most important thing to understand about the structure. Unlike a Private Limited Company or an LLP, a proprietorship is legally the same person as its owner. The business cannot contract in its own name, cannot hold property in its own name, and does not receive its own PAN. There is also no limit on the proprietor's liability for business debts."}]}]]}],["$","details","Is there a government proprietorship registration certificate?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-3","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is there a government proprietorship registration certificate?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"No. There is no single registration or certificate that establishes a proprietorship, because it is not incorporated. A proprietorship is evidenced by the registrations it actually holds, most commonly Udyam registration, GST registration where applicable, and a shop and establishment registration. Be cautious of any provider that claims to issue a government proprietorship certificate."}]}]]}],"$L56","$L57","$L58","$L59","$L5a","$L5b","$L5c"]}]]}]}]
