56:["$","details","Who should choose a proprietorship?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-4","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Who should choose a proprietorship?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"It suits a single owner starting small, where the business is not carrying significant liability risk and there is no plan to bring in partners or investors. Freelancers, consultants, local retailers and small service businesses commonly start this way. If you need limited liability or intend to raise funding, look at an LLP or a Private Limited Company instead."}]}]]}]
57:["$","details","What registrations may be applicable?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-5","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What registrations may be applicable?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Udyam (MSME) registration, which is free and widely accepted as proof of the business. GST registration where turnover crosses the threshold or where the nature of supply makes it compulsory. Shop and establishment registration under state law for commercial premises. Beyond those, activity-specific licences such as FSSAI for food businesses, Import Export Code for import or export, and professional tax where the state levies it."}]}]]}]
58:["$","details","Is GST registration compulsory for a proprietorship?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-6","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Is GST registration compulsory for a proprietorship?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Not always. It becomes compulsory once turnover crosses the applicable threshold, and irrespective of turnover in certain cases including inter-state supply of goods and supply through an e-commerce operator. Thresholds differ for goods and services and by state category. Some proprietors register voluntarily because business customers require a GST invoice to claim input credit. We assess which applies to your specific activity before filing."}]}]]}]
59:["$","details","What documents are needed?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-7","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"What documents are needed?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"The proprietor's PAN and Aadhaar, a photograph, proof of the place of business, a rent agreement if the premises are rented, a no-objection certificate from the owner, and bank details for Udyam registration."}]}]]}]
5a:["$","details","How do I open a current account for a proprietorship?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-8","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How do I open a current account for a proprietorship?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Banks open a current account in the business name against the proprietor's PAN and Aadhaar together with proof that the business exists. Under RBI KYC norms most banks ask for two such proofs, which in practice means a combination such as Udyam registration plus a GST certificate or shop and establishment registration."}]}]]}]
5b:["$","details","How is a proprietorship taxed?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-9","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"How is a proprietorship taxed?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Business income is included in the proprietor's own income tax return and taxed at the individual slab rates applicable to them, rather than at a separate rate for the business. There is no separate return for the business. A tax audit becomes applicable once turnover crosses the threshold under section 44AB, and presumptive taxation under sections 44AD or 44ADA may be available depending on the nature and scale of the activity."}]}]]}]
5c:["$","details","Can a proprietorship be converted into a company or LLP later?",{"className":"group","id":"proprietorship-registration-faq-10","name":"proprietorship-registration-faq","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-5 text-left font-semibold text-secondary marker:hidden hover:bg-muted/60 sm:px-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Can a proprietorship be converted into a company or LLP later?"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"mt-1 shrink-0 text-xl leading-none text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Yes. A proprietor can incorporate a Private Limited Company or an LLP and transfer the business to it, or form a partnership by bringing in a partner. This is a common path once the business grows, takes on more risk, or needs to look incorporated to its customers and lenders."}]}]]}]
